From 32f39fc434e76848dc7429ac35649bdec54a515c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Belfry <belfry@belfry.local>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 08:46:37 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(belfry): community apps on the dashboard

A participant who signs in lands on the dashboard, which linked to no app.
GET /api/user/apps returns BELFRY_COMMUNITY_APPS (Name|URL|Description
entries separated by ';') and the dashboard shows them first as
"Community apps" cards. Unset: no card.
